        "TileImage": "$($repository 4f790c6b-95ff-4bb1-bcf5-41969e57f0ec).Image",
        "Description": "The global innovation rave from Miami draws a lot of people and resources together. Today we can use it to our advantage. \r\rHere is the rundown: in the vip area there are  Hector Delgado, brother of Rico Delgado, the ruthless cartel boss and corrupt Sheikh Suleiman Al-Ghazali. Killing them would be a great service to many.\r\rAdditionally the Kronstadt expo building full or scientists is in the area. We want you to cripple their AI and military operations by eliminating 3 key researches.",
